Z||000021||87GTZ34||04-09-2001||01:35 PM||||Here's my 2 cents on the education thang...<BR>Education is not necessarily a measure of intelligence or brains.  Typically it is a measure of opportunity; i.e. those that have the opportunity and desire to cont after HS do.  There are educated folks that I toss in the stupid bucket, and there are many non-degree folks that are very bright.  IQ is a gift or inheritance not something an individual can 'build' through education.  So to think anyone is less intelligent because they didn't cont on after HS is in fact ignorance or stupidity.  Of course I give everyone here points for being fiero fanatics...<BR>On trolling - I could never understand with the limited time & energy every person has, why would anyone want to waste it trolling???<P>BTW Cliff thanks for the spell checker.  It doesn't know the word f i e r o though.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>87GTZ34<P>[This message has been edited by 87GTZ34 (edited 04-09-2001).]<p>[This message has been edited by 87GTZ34 (edited 04-09-2001).]||||reg||3
